  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Slice cucumber into half-moons. Thinly slice capsicum.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook capsicum, until tender, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a large bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67ce9c4cfc617b70a129fdc2-0e7810ea.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil .\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove pan from heat, add the honey and turn to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67ce9c4cfc617b70a129fdc2-997a5b71.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Halve corn cobs. Transfer corn to a large microwave-safe plate. Cover with a damp paper towel. Microwave corn on high, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Toast or grill pita bread to your liking.\n• In a small bowl, combine light sour cream and peri-peri seasoning (see ingredients).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67ce9c4cfc617b70a129fdc2-c4d3415f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the bowl with the capsicum, add cucumber, mixed salad leaves, grated Parmesan cheese and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.\n• Halve pita bread and fill with capsicum salad and haloumi. Top with peri-peri sour cream.\n• Divide between plates. Serve with corn cobs and any remaining salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67ce9c4cfc617b70a129fdc2-032ffaa3.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
